Q: question 3 A: answer 3

generate_flashcards_tsv

This will generate a file named flashcards.tsv containing
code tsv
	<p>question 1</p>	<p>answer 1</p>
	<p>question 2</p>	<p>answer 2</p>
	<p>question 3</p>	<p>answer 3</p>

A scheduler can then read all flashcards.tsv files in the project.
